WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  features/analytics/components/review/SlideRenderer.tsx — the Year-in-Review slide-deck renderer. Routes
  slide.type over a YearReview payload to one of TEN child slides (Title / StatHero / StatChart /
  DriveHighlight / ChargingBreakdown / Savings / Environment / Patterns / Comparisons / Summary), wrapped in
  AnimatePresence (x-slide + opacity, 0.35s easeInOut) with a per-slide gradient background. The file's two
  direct t() calls are yearReview.longestDrive / yearReview.mostEfficient; the composed child slides supply
  the rest. The child-slide surfaces are separate prompts and are NOT yet present, so — exactly as the
  0237-AiUsageCard precedent did for the not-yet-present <UsageCard> primitive — their content is reproduced
  as private subviews scoped to THIS surface (the only files this prompt may touch).

