PARITY COVERAGE (every web region + branch reproduced)
  Composition  : SlideReviewDeck.definitions = the 12 SLIDE_DEFS (10 kinds; distance/energy hero + longest/
                 efficient drive-highlight twice), each with a token-based accent gradient (the native peer of the
                 web Tailwind from/via/to). SlideReviewSlideView is the native switch (web renderSlideContent).
  Transition   : direction-aware horizontal move + opacity (web x:50→0→-50, 0.35s easeInOut), reduce-motion →
                 .opacity; swipe + prev/next + tappable progress dots drive the index the web parent owned.
  Arithmetic   : distance convertDistanceFromSI(km*1000,unit); efficiency *1.609344 for mi; duration h/m; 12-hour
                 clock; earthLaps/40075 (≥0.01 branch + "Every kilometer counts!"); home-days /30; trees /21; cups
                 /5; gas-equiv = savings+cost; electric% = round(cost/equiv*100); charging slices filter >0 — all
                 unit-asserted against the web expressions (en_US goldens).
  Slides       : Title (year/subtitle/vehicle) · StatHero ×2 (distance w/ earth-lap or small comparison; energy w/
                 home-days) · StatChart (total + drives/week + labelled monthly bar row) · DriveHighlight ×2
                 (route + distance/duration/efficiency grid + date, OR the "No drive data" empty branch) · Charging
                 (sessions + avg-SoC + donut[TSPieChart] + percent legend, zero-slices filtered) · Savings (saved
                 hero + gas/electric comparison bars + cups note) · Environment (CO2 + trees-equiv + capped tree
                 grid + "+N more") · Patterns (favourite day + peak hour + 3 averages) · Comparisons (fun-fact grid)
                 · Summary (recap card: 5 stat rows + optional savings line + screenshot hint).
  Charts/maps  : web source lists none; the two composed child slides that the web draws with Recharts are mapped
